control: The latency baseline is the lowest of the last ten medians of one-minute windows holding at least 20 samples
removes: every remembered median counts, so an early low median holds the baseline down forever
packages: ./ratelimit/core
tests: TestRememberMedian TestBaseline TestALastingRiseBecomesTheBaseline
scheduled-count: no

